        "cache_input_is_phonemes": true,
        "cache_preexisted": true
      },
      {
        "sentence": "S1",
        "piece": 3,
        "source_slice": "drank a brew of beef broth into which the microbial growth of two Petri dishes had been scraped.",
        "exact_native_cache_key": "43a057538b7828f596a1cbc6e70fc6eb584b73ab.pkl",
        "cache_input_text_sha256": "8eefba857782414eb2b70847e1cf18141e3c5d516a72406d6849a4c83f77c907",
        "cache_input_is_phonemes": false,
        "cache_preexisted": true
      },
      {
        "sentence": "S2",
        "piece": 1,
        "source_slice": "The prevalent doctrine blamed ulcers on stress,",
        "exact_native_cache_key": "6598b4918c1dddcbc694dfbbf6d2ba59b2079542.pkl",
        "cache_input_text_sha256": "879f093eab75e24214e8f97715c16bc2893b076f85fc36547c0631b74bdb3c9f",
        "cache_input_is_phonemes": false,
        "cache_preexisted": true
      },
      {
        "sentence": "S2",
        "piece": 2,
        "source_slice": "spicy food,",
        "exact_native_cache_key": "d55615d76b17e182364263eb82a7307efab24d7d.pkl",
        "cache_input_text_sha256": "b7b94e611765e1c5b769229b234da38b18ad24d5bd7857c058d7761a965b9dc2",
        "cache_input_is_phonemes": false,
        "cache_preexisted": true
      },
      {
        "sentence": "S2",
        "piece": 3,
        "source_slice": "and excess acid secretion.",
        "exact_native_cache_key": "55afaf0fb75ed5657d2c49acecdceda7ef1d4f3b.pkl",
        "cache_input_text_sha256": "1293e895345931d5b9b715767b251a14b7fb0dbc2730390753afb4d93f1fd8cd",
        "cache_input_is_phonemes": false,
        "cache_preexisted": true
      },
      {
        "sentence": "S3",
        "piece": 1,
        "source_slice": "No bacterium,",
        "exact_native_cache_key": "8f103b907e8fa896f637a053bcb159dd07a17b28.pkl",
        "cache_input_text_sha256": "bf8543822107fc54acde3d99cf3588ab19ae81884ef1da6d51a2b04247f7a3fa",
        "cache_input_is_phonemes": false,
        "cache_preexisted": true
      },
      {
        "sentence": "S3",
        "piece": 2,
        "source_slice": "the profession firmly held,",
        "exact_native_cache_key": "15a2e8ba38eaa4fba34f46446dba61df79a5eb46.pkl",
        "cache_input_text_sha256": "9c0df999aea968ebfc470f1ebbe4e0c90dab2fa9eb184c96d511211e9587874c",
        "cache_input_is_phonemes": false,
        "cache_preexisted": true
      },
      {
        "sentence": "S3",
        "piece": 3,
        "source_slice": "could withstand so caustic and hostile a habitat.",
        "exact_native_cache_key": "6cdfa3f375f3258946fdaf7dc3117b2d12d619ee.pkl",
        "cache_input_text_sha256": "5ec0017fbf651c45f8ced09337beacf43d7049b69c8ea7173338dffd6fd02607",
        "cache_input_is_phonemes": false,
        "cache_preexisted": true
      },
      {
        "sentence": "S4",
        "piece": 1,
        "source_slice": "Yet Robin Warren,",
        "exact_native_cache_key": "35d6c29a75d5e3e6b95c2b75c3d9f23c9e9e290d.pkl",
        "cache_input_text_sha256": "e8b28ae435ef41d1f31426d87d9cb653506c5b21045056ee448e38fb0e7f6d27",
        "cache_input_is_phonemes": false,
        "cache_preexisted": true
      },
      {
        "sentence": "S4",
        "piece": 2,
        "source_slice": "a pathologist at Royal Perth Hospital,",
        "exact_native_cache_key": "20e77d1edcc12dbd0c6ab7fdc121cdca4af1f494.pkl",
        "cache_input_text_sha256": "d6369cbc47ee704a7a0ecd08645c909ef6a4e30ead77d9c9f13530309b23958f",
        "cache_input_is_phonemes": false,
        "cache_preexisted": true
      },
      {
        "sentence": "S4",
        "piece": 3,
        "source_slice": "had seen curved,",
        "exact_native_cache_key": "b6f892daaf0c79903675c62f8ddac4388b6f4852.pkl",
        "cache_input_text_sha256": "00745bd47f18e70063816b1fba955223255a6133ad9ed63f59840366efd4c73a",
        "cache_input_is_phonemes": false,
        "cache_preexisted": true
      },
      {
        "sentence": "S4",
        "piece": 4,
        "source_slice": "coiled bacteria in gastric biopsies from patients with gastritis.",
        "exact_native_cache_key": "097954e915f7f80c17d0a39557a668dcffe7939e.pkl",
        "cache_input_text_sha256": "e3c6f2d11a982742e98808f1b5316ccaf3958297395e0b8cdecb7b0e6d482ba8",
        "cache_input_is_phonemes": true,
        "cache_preexisted": true
      },
      {
        "sentence": "S6",
        "piece": 1,
        "source_slice": "Attempts to culture the germ were invariably unsuccessful until Easter 1982,",
        "exact_native_cache_key": "e38c782ef1f7069589e2745d46100ca102a6efbd.pkl",
        "cache_input_text_sha256": "90e54d241932de5668a42803667466196efbd7abe8a0196d6318a96950c1ca68",
        "cache_input_is_phonemes": false,
        "cache_preexisted": true
      },
      {
        "sentence": "S6",
        "piece": 2,
        "source_slice": "when plates sat undisturbed in the incubator for about five days.",
        "exact_native_cache_key": "aecd8385ef08804fc662850e0398f8ddf3505167.pkl",
        "cache_input_text_sha256": "92914c3bfcbc8e8463de30c44c884d0b334dc2fcfdd0661793edf22ece4741d3",
        "cache_input_is_phonemes": false,
        "cache_preexisted": true
      },
      {
        "sentence": "S13",
        "piece": 1,
        "source_slice": "Within days Marshall was vomiting,",
        "exact_native_cache_key": "f1d3eccac514419260223b2b764763b2844e1185.pkl",
        "cache_input_text_sha256": "3f802735bd9b8fc78d8432b78a292db2836c42ed7262f1bc3b2e064a08f1bf2e",
        "cache_input_is_phonemes": false,
        "cache_preexisted": true
      },
      {
        "sentence": "S13",
        "piece": 2,
        "source_slice": "his breath had a disagreeable odour and weariness set in.",
        "exact_native_cache_key": "7556d01156329123c61203329883ef62977443d3.pkl",
        "cache_input_text_sha256": "1737fff90b278ac2ac7582dba54c054e00d4a67609fa9b99e503005ced9b7dd1",
        "cache_input_is_phonemes": false,
        "cache_preexisted": true
      },
      {
        "sentence": "S14",
        "piece": 1,
        "source_slice": "About ten days later an endoscopy revealed gastritis,",
        "exact_native_cache_key": "1ec57782d1ed00d356d0928d89588478c67b6f63.pkl",
        "cache_input_text_sha256": "4b0ecb74035781f7528e6ed9b46d0b294f9645ba301adf8955bcc95708d0dbee",
        "cache_input_is_phonemes": true,
        "cache_preexisted": true
      },
      {
        "sentence": "S14",
        "piece": 2,
        "source_slice": "an inflammation of the stomach's mucous membrane and a precursor to ulcers,",
        "exact_native_cache_key": "2f2401b95bca6b46200036eb0ea07e4c03ccccba.pkl",
        "cache_input_text_sha256": "3e435c9bbf6428ae0d190ec1e94597af9892969bad37b2eb0ca26dfd6e828d6f",
        "cache_input_is_phonemes": false,
        "cache_preexisted": true
      },
      {
        "sentence": "S14",
        "piece": 3,
        "source_slice": "albeit not an ulcer itself.",
        "exact_native_cache_key": "74394635d986bb41e4754b4bf55e542eb0c80c64.pkl",
        "cache_input_text_sha256": "733f81410f533ca913ec47bd7de6c24246951be47046771cfaa7f15306f4e31c",
        "cache_input_is_phonemes": false,
        "cache_preexisted": true
      },
      {
        "sentence": "S16",
        "piece": 1,
        "source_slice": "Spurred on by his insistent spouse,",
        "exact_native_cache_key": "7ddba8b8a046e3cce103f81ecf0d850f5b166e7e.pkl",
        "cache_input_text_sha256": "112aee42a841144a620579ea65613616fe952f5812877bd9f1f9b5c977e5e624",
        "cache_input_is_phonemes": false,
        "cache_preexisted": true
      },
      {
        "sentence": "S16",
        "piece": 2,
        "source_slice": "Marshall took antibiotics,",
        "exact_native_cache_key": "e60af417d4ea7a16a9479fc5a98fd00bb8a21a3e.pkl",
        "cache_input_text_sha256": "b18b43d3ebd85c3fbbd83e01d090b41552c3a2747ced09746e4a00d19c25d2df",
        "cache_input_is_phonemes": false,
        "cache_preexisted": true
      },
      {
        "sentence": "S16",
        "piece": 3,
        "source_slice": "which cleared the infection.",
        "exact_native_cache_key": "01a8fadd2a9ab5822a01731848f793d162718590.pkl",
        "cache_input_text_sha256": "667cf7fd7d3e018ff6d6b8637cabcf1c15e7d0a18227319858a4d911d2209860",
        "cache_input_is_phonemes": false,
        "cache_preexisted": true
      },
      {
        "sentence": "S19",
        "piece": 1,
        "source_slice": "Gastritis,",
        "exact_native_cache_key": "87dc9245fa6ec133d287103c50622dd329df8295.pkl",
        "cache_input_text_sha256": "b72899480d253be3567741a944128fa289c2523baf4aebd440c993b4405cc0fd",
        "cache_input_is_phonemes": false,
        "cache_preexisted": true
      },
